Representative BIDS eye-tracking outputs generated by smi2bids.

The source SMI files and regeneration instructions are in the parent directory.
The source data and converted eye-tracking outputs retain their applicable HBN
licences and are not covered by the smi2bids software licence. See the parent
directory's HBN_DATA.md for attribution and citations.
StartTime is set to zero because these examples do not perform synchronization
to another recording modality.

Each subject also has a minimal events.tsv file so that this physiology-only
example has a primary task file for BIDS Validator traversal. Those four TSV
files are test scaffolding, not smi2bids output.
